MODULE: NoFlappingZeroSentinelIgnored
TARGET: NoFlapping
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: disabled recovery still manufactures a floor on a raw Healthy tree
PERTURBS: Sample
BOUNDS: RecoveryWindow = 0

--- FIND
    /\ verdict' = [t \in Trees |-> [p \in Partitions |-> PartitionVerdict(t, p)]]
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: impose a recovery floor even when it was explicitly disabled.
    /\ verdict' = [t \in Trees |-> [p \in Partitions |-> Max(1, PartitionVerdict(t, p))]]
--- END
--- FIND
    /\ treeVerdict' = [t \in Trees |-> TreeValue(t)]
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: publish the same spurious floor in the tree roll-up.
    /\ treeVerdict' = [t \in Trees |-> Max(1, TreeValue(t))]
--- END
